The Edge Graph Protocol. Models system dependencies as addressable edges.
Defines the `edge://` realm for capability discovery and materialization.
Supports weighted edges (Mass + Entropy) to prioritize lowest-cost solutions.


Root: SATOSHI (Time Anchor)
Ref: EdgeGraph.sigma

### Addressable Edge Format
```
edge://<realm>/<capability>/<version>
```
Examples: `edge://brew/rust/1.75`, `edge://dns-txt/I.sigma/v0`.

### Collapse Logic
Pick the cheapest valid edge; cache it; pass to offspring.

